// Curved-sword moveset (WP-051). Source: docs/game/04-arsenal-and-builds.md, "Weapon classes":
// flowing combos and chained spins, fast, 1.9 m reach, Finesse. Frame numbers are tuning
// unless a spec line says otherwise. Dodges (roll, backstep) are shared in common.ron; the
// critical pair is shared in crits.ron, and the weapon's crit_mult_percent (100) sets the crit.
// total_frames = startup + active + recovery; a hitbox window is (startup, startup + active - 1).
// Schema: crates/content/src/moves.rs.
